.DS_Store

# jetbrains setting folder
.idea/
brand/Zuga-Brand-Package.zip

# Design-bible PDF exports. These are Chrome print-to-PDF renders of
# docs/bible/ (Producer: Skia/PDF) — output, not source, and stale the instant
# the markdown moves. Two of them sat untracked from 2026-07-01 to 2026-08-31,
# by which point the bible had been edited past both. Polished binaries belong
# in the Zuga Brand Assets Drive folder, which is the same rule that already
# ignores brand/Zuga-Brand-Package.zip above.
#
# Ignored rather than deleted: the exports themselves are cheap to regenerate,
# but nothing in this repo regenerates them, so the copies on disk are the only
# copies. Leaving them present and unseen costs nothing; removing them would
# throw away the only artifact.
*.pdf
# A PDF the site actually SERVES is content, not an export — keep tracking those.
!public/**/*.pdf
